+NEVER trust someone pretending to work for the 'Customer Support Team'
+RHEA Finance has NO formal 'Customer Support Team'.
+We will
+NEVER
+:
+❌ Send you a direct message claiming to represent customer support or someone working directly for the team
+❌ Ask you for your private key or recovery phrase
+​If you're having trouble, please contact us directly via our
+official social channels
+.
+ALWAYS use RHEA Finance verified domains
+Bookmark:
+https://www.rhea.finance/
+If you ever have any doubt of the URL, please use our linked URL on the official Ref Finance Twitter profile or alternatively, reach out to a Moderator in our
+official social channels
+.
+If you believe that you have been scammed, please report it to one of our moderators.
